WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:09.570
under our Western democratic systems we have&nbsp;
had freedom so long we have come to take it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:17.460
for granted it has lost its revolutionary&nbsp;
flavor we in the Atlantic community see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:24.750
our right to criticize opposed and peaceably&nbsp;
advocate changes in government as evolutionary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:35.470
but this freedom to speak out which&nbsp;
we have made part of our nature well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:41.830
behind the Iron Curtain the introduction of&nbsp;
such freedoms would indeed be revolutionary

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:52.880
so I think of the open societies of the Atlanta&nbsp;
community as having produced what one might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:01:02.750
call the permanent revolution of Western&nbsp;
man this freedom is the true revolution

